<view class="page-bg"><image class="page-bg-img" src="/assets/bg/night-stars.png" mode="widthFix" /></view>

<view class="page-shell">
  <text class="eyebrow">隐私与授权</text>
  <text class="page-title">每一份授权都可撤回</text>
  <text class="page-subtitle">默认不会因为小程序语音会话而自动保存原始音频。</text>

  <view class="card consent-card {{consent ? 'consent-on' : ''}}">
    <view class="consent-shield">
      <text class="consent-shield-icon">{{consent ? '✓' : '✧'}}</text>
    </view>
    <text class="privacy-status">{{consent ? '原始语音归档已授权' : '原始语音归档未授权'}}</text>
    <text wx:if="{{consent}}" class="privacy-detail">授权时间：{{consent.granted_at}}<br />策略：{{consent.retention_policy}}</text>
    <text wx:else class="privacy-detail">实时语音仍会经过现有语音服务完成识别与回应；是否归档原始音频需要单独明确同意。</text>
    <button wx:if="{{!consent}}" class="primary-button privacy-button" loading="{{acting}}" bindtap="grant">明确授权原始语音归档</button>
    <button wx:else class="danger-button privacy-button" loading="{{acting}}" bindtap="revoke">撤回并删除受授权音频</button>
    <text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-text">{{error}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card privacy-note">
    <text class="privacy-note-title">身份与媒体边界</text>
    <text class="privacy-detail">小程序只获得短期媒体网关票据，不接触 LiveKit participant token 或服务端密钥；说话人、历史资格、数字分身与权限均由服务端判定。</text>
  </view>
</view>
